{
  "_comment": [
    "metric -> ordered candidates (index = priority). The LTM is built per candidate; the first candidate with a complete LTM wins.",
    "A candidate is 'prefix:Name' (the consolidated, no-dimension fact), 'prefix:Name[axis=member;axis=member]' (that exact dimension set), or 'A+B' (sum; every term must exist).",
    "kind: flow = duration fact (LTM built from FY + YTD - prior YTD); instant = balance-sheet fact at the period end.",
    "unit: USD | USD/shares | shares. 'overrides' are per-ticker lists tried BEFORE the defaults; [] switches the metric off for that ticker.",
    "Add an override when gold_bloomberg_reconciliation shows a miss; silver_ltm_lineage shows which candidate was used."
  ],
